        "location": "whole file"
      },
      {
        "severity": "uncertain_reading",
        "description": "12 of 164 pages in the source scan extract as inverted mojibake, including pages 49, 51 and 53 inside the cut-out CONDENSED CHECK LIST block. Sections that fell on those pages are omitted here rather than reconstructed: notably DITCHING, ENGINE FIRE IN FLIGHT, FIRE DURING ENGINE START, and part of the exterior inspection right-hand side. Resolving them requires reading the page images.",
        "location": "whole file"
      },
      {
        "severity": "content_gap",
